  <item>
    <title>Some More Personal News, October 2025</title>
    <link>https://pressthink.org/2025/10/some-more-personal-news-october-2025/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://pressthink.org/2025/10/some-more-personal-news-october-2025/</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 01 Oct 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <description>In October 2025, it was announced that the author, after five years at New York University, would be leaving their position as Professor of Journalism and Silly Walks and Director of the Studio 20 Program. Their last day at NYU will be December 31, 2025. They will be joining the University of California, Berkeley, as Professor of Digital Media and Silly Walks at the Graduate School of Journalism and Director of the New Media Innovation Studio, beginning January 1, 2026. The move was a difficult decision, but the opportunity at Berkeley and the chance to work with Professor Python were major draws. They and their family will be moving to Berkeley in late December.
</description>
